  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Confronting gender violence in three communities in the province of Matanzas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote women&apos;s empowerment and economic and social position by strengthening women&apos;s ability for independence and autonomy in three local communities in Matanzas province. Through the creation of local meeting places for women&apos;s self-care, development of training programs for the women and their families and psychological support. The project seeks to prevent gender-based violence.</narrative>
  </description>
